{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "45cb19e2-57a6-5cb9-980b-95e2c7e728d8", "source_ordinal": 880, "reading_ordinal": 3177, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "枯燥生活", "published_at": "2025-03-28T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/24dca22005d611f0b7155254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "从外人的角度看来，张三的生活样式是“除了吃饭睡觉，就是在画图，从来不出去吃喝玩乐”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "枯燥之极。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "问题是从张三的角度来看，我这个月画的是影剧院的图，上个月画的是公共图书馆的图，下个月画的是度假酒店，下下个月画的是名人纪念堂。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我何止不觉得枯燥，甚至还觉得有点过于精彩，快乐得影响睡眠呢。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其实这种“枯燥”是一个看不到别人的精彩的人对自己所不理解的生活的评价。这约等于一个视力障碍者评价“你家真黑”罢了。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "撇开这个不谈，你需要心里有一个数——如果你打算“厉害”，那么正常来说，你就应该会有一个“生活枯燥”的名声。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你应该有一种占用自己大块时间的、孤独的、但却因为勇猛精进而让你乐此不疲、同时有价值的成果层出不穷的乐趣。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "乐此不疲自然占用大块时间了，这一条放下不说。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "为什么要孤独的？因为孤独的享乐稳定，不受其他参与者的干扰削弱。如果你总是需要某些人来参与才能重现你的专注，你的“厉害”当然成色不高。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "为什么要勇猛精进？因为只有不断的深入、升华，不断进入新的境界，才能让这件事有无限的深度，积累出越来越强的技巧和资产。否则它最多也只是一阵风就过去了，不会有长期的坚持造成的巨大的相对优势。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "为什么要有价值？因为若无价值——例如所谓的休闲小游戏——这只是一种快乐的长葬礼。一个人在不产生任何使用价值的事务上经验丰富——例如极其擅长给自己抓痒——又有什么“厉害”可言？", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这三个要素齐全，才会出现“枯燥 + 厉害”的双重效果。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 608}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这也是“厉害的人往往生活枯燥”现象的底层原因。", "char_start": 609, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这种所谓“枯燥”，只是没有别人在场的精彩。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 654}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么有些人明明很厉害，ta们的生活看起来却很枯燥？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“枯燥生活”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“从外人的角度看来，张三的生活样式是“除了吃饭睡觉，就是在画图，从来不出去吃喝玩乐”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "从外人的角度看来，张三的生活样式是“除了吃饭睡觉，就是在画图，从来不出去吃喝玩乐”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8df7f928-d2cc-5fe3-94ed-fdb34abe810d", "source_ordinal": 879, "reading_ordinal": 3178, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "涂鸦", "published_at": "2025-03-28T13:55:21.695000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/15478386679/answer/1888951650909151804"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不支持。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 4}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "教导子女完成正确的社会化是绝对的首要任务。", "char_start": 5, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "完成了正确的社会化，才能在最大限度上避免各种社交风险、价值观反复、人格崩溃甚至社会性危机。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "没有正确的社会化，容易卷入霸凌或者被霸凌事件；", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "容易与老师、同学、亲友爆发激烈矛盾；", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "容易沾染不良风气；", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "容易丧失对父母的信任和合作；", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "容易发作傲慢心、猜忌心、贪婪心、恶毒心。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这上面任何一条发作，都会导致所谓的“天才”遭遇重挫甚至夭折。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "任何卓越的才能，都需要在多方助力下反复借力，才能不断获得必要的动力和助力保持聚焦持续积累。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那是一个用强的发光的爱的能力反复激发周围人不由自主的爱的剧变过程。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "召唤出周围的人不由自主的爱，从而获得最强的保护和爱惜，才是一切天才幸存和成就奇迹的关键要素。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不是什么天生丽质、绝对音准、善于抓型。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这些都微不足道。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "远不如“是所有老师的心头好”“总是全班的团宠”重要。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "否则一次与老师激烈的口角、一次傲慢导致的嚣张大发作、一次因集体妒忌导致的大排挤、一次因嫉妒导致的恶意中伤、一次因求而不得造成的造谣污蔑就足以导致你的“小天才”抑郁、磕药、退学、自杀。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "什么“天才”都白搭。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因此，从小分清楚什么可做、什么不可做，什么该做，什么不该做，什么事要怎么做，远比搞这种“天才宝宝”幻觉重要。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "能稳固的抑制身边的敌意，激发身边的好意，拥有坚固的安全感和积极性，是一切真正卓越才能的基础。", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "有这个底子，任何兴趣都容易踏上正轨发育成别人瞠目结舌的专业能力。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "没有这个底子，第一隔三差五就陷入各种drama里，总是进三步滑两步原地打转积累绝望感；第二真的侥幸得到了什么值得觊觎的能力立刻就要陷入周围深不可测的阴谋算计之中。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "要么搞不成，要么搞成了招祸。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "所以答案根本不必犹豫——", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "绝不纵容。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 729}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你能允许孩子在家里墙面、地板、桌椅上，到处乱涂乱画吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“涂鸦”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不支持。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不支持。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 4, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "81978e89-fd35-580b-a6ae-2e0e6c88652d", "source_ordinal": 878, "reading_ordinal": 3179, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "铜人", "published_at": "2025-03-29T00:13:11.876000+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/0d2846a40be211f08bcc5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这话是不对的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "挽救自杀是社会对自杀者应尽的一种礼仪。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这不是“不许”，不是“阻止”，而是一种礼仪。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "怎么解释呢？有点像所谓的少林十八铜人阵，看似要把每个想下山的人打回去，但这本质上并不是“禁止下山”的意思。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "社会见到zs的人，必须要尽这个礼。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人无法阻止死志已决的人，这是毫无疑问的，硬要去阻止，的确可以说是浪费社会的资源反而造成当事人无谓的痛苦。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但社会必须用真诚的挽回礼来确保当事人的确是死志已绝。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不是装模作样的、不是虚情假意的、不是虚应故事的，而是真诚的、尽力的、严肃的，善尽礼仪。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "就像十八铜人拦你下山，出拳绝不留手，阻拦决不宽纵。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为只有这样，才能保证你真的闯过去时，你真的有下山的资格。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这不是一个“无论如何、不择手段、绝不能让ta成功”的态度。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "社会阻止人zs的努力也一样，社会只能接受的确死志已绝的人弃绝人生。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "作为“人类的方舟”，这是社会不能舍弃的机能，为这本质的机能付出成本，不属于浪费。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这就像一把菜刀切菜切钝了不能叫浪费、一根蜡烛用来照亮被烧短了不能叫浪费一样。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "事实上，这是一个普遍的法则——凡事欲行，唯尽义、尽礼，而后顺其自然。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "礼肃、义诚、事尽，事情就从你的手里交到了历史、命运的手里。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 511}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你就可以站到一旁，看历史和命运如何了。", "char_start": 512, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不要越礼非义，强求你自己私意执着的结果，那样你自己必耗竭，且事往往无补而恶甚。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 571}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样反驳那些说“他们跳楼就让他们跳去吧，别浪费资源”的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“铜人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这话是不对的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这话是不对的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b5082584-2e68-523f-96c9-d87c8ca37224", "source_ordinal": 877, "reading_ordinal": 3180, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "长线持股", "published_at": "2025-03-29T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/c9d94d88064311f0bf825254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "买卖的目标是得到结构更好的投资组合。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“卖”不是为了得到现金，而是为了在更低的价位重新吃进或者切换到更有利可图的标的上。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "持续交易的最后结果是不断拉低的持有成本 / 同等投资额下持有更多的股权。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "下跌不必怕，及时卖出部分，然后在更低处接回来，运气好还会在大跌之日做出利润来。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这样交替下降，你真正损失的是你持有期间跌掉的那部分，但是这是你买到“当时在场”的合理成本。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "股票投资是一种“长期守候形同鸡肋，历史性暴涨瞬间完成”的游戏。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "很多人都幻想自己可以整个的跳过“形同鸡肋的长期守候”，尤其是凭借“英明的判断”避开那些痛苦恐怖的长期的或者猛烈的下跌，但这样做会严重地放大“历史性暴涨时你并不在场”的概率。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "等你听到消息，一切都已经在不到一天——甚至更短——的时间里基本结束了。不错，你还可以匆匆入市，因为在这历史性大涨之后往往还惯性的有几天令人欣喜的上涨，幅度相当喜人。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但是这部分涨幅相当脆弱，稍微回撤就会吃掉你那“相当喜人的利润”，甚至会跌掉那“关键一天”的部分涨幅，这个时候，匆匆追涨的你的账面上会是惨烈的亏损。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为你信奉“不赚就全卖掉，下回牛市再进来”的策略，你很可能在这时净亏离场。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而那些“从不离场，遇到熊市就交替掩护以降低持仓成本”的玩家呢？首先ta们手里仍有相当的利润没有亏掉，仍然是盈利的，其次ta们往往又再次利用做T技巧压缩了这些跌幅对自己的伤害。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "股价跌了10%，但是ta们只亏了3%。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而ta们仍然持续在场。", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "无论何时发生大涨，ta们总会在场。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "抓住了一两次大涨，那么在随时注意减轻下跌损失的前提下，之后的亏损是很难把这些成果完全吞掉的。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这样就会实现“只损失利润，不损失本金”的效果。", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 706}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而基于这个总体盈利的财务状态，你又会反过来比较容易保持理智和冷静。", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "看准历史大势，持有经营有力、战略领先的股票。", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "把眼睛盯在“更低的持仓成本”上，不断的拿出部分资金，去试探“也许我猜错了”的可能性，保持在场。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "通过“保持在场”不断加深你对投资标的的触觉和经验，提高你的判断可靠性。", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 848}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "耐心等待历史给你回应。", "char_start": 849, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这是一个值得你考虑的策略。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 874}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：请问股票的投资理念是什么？如何进行长线投资？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“长线持股”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“买卖的目标是得到结构更好的投资组合。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "买卖的目标是得到结构更好的投资组合。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "01a80dcd-f154-5b79-a0f4-28b2f294d3b7", "source_ordinal": 876, "reading_ordinal": 3181, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不改之路", "published_at": "2025-03-30T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/82e64540074a11f0a09052540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "先要确认预付款、修改费用、修改周期、终止合作条款这些关键的合同细节才能承接这个客户。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "简单来说：", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）要有预付款才能开工，预付款应该能覆盖初稿到第一轮修改的成本和合理利润。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）要约定第一轮修改后的后续修改的报价权和结算要求。这是指如果初次修改后的结果你不满意，那么默认合同是直接结束的。你可以根据合同拒绝支付剩余尾款，以降低你的损失，而这时我作为供应商处于保本状态。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你需要第二次修改，那么你需要先结清上一轮的全款。如果不结清全款，后续的合作是没有可能的。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "然后你给出的修改需求会被视为新的设计合同，我方给你新的报价。如果你同意，那就需要再次支付预付款后我们再开工。如果你无法同意，同样合作自然终止。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "后续无论多少次修改，都按照这个标准模式无限循环。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这样，客户无论要修改多少次，都是不断的追加合同和重复付款的过程，我方当然会专心致志、敬业负责的给出新的设计结果。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而且无论何时终止合作，双方都没有什么恩怨可言。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "有人肯定会说——“这太不现实了，没有哪个客户会按这个方式跟你合作”。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "第一，在拿到这样的合作地位之前，设计、开发单位需要先把自己的战略目标设定为“扬名立万”，而不是“马上赚钱”。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "也就是先通过获奖作品、家喻户晓的知名作品、行内闻名遐迩的成功案例树立自己的名誉，然后凭借这个名誉来按照这个健康模式运营，而不是在无法建立名誉之前用所谓“改到满意为止”的谎言浪费职业生命、出售人格价值。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 601}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你做不到，那是你的事。你做不到，在这一行里你就不是在“生存”，而只是在慢慢死亡而已。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 645}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为这个模式是职业生存的起点线。", "char_start": 646, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不能按这个模式运转，你是否会积累重大的系统风险就极大的依赖于景气。一旦不景气，你之前赚到的利润都要被坏账吞掉——因为你的员工必须按月领到工资，而不是等你改完无数轮拿到所谓的“尾款”之后才领薪水。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "换言之，如果你按照“无限修改改到满意再拿钱”的模式拿单子，你要么在实际上改完第一稿之后就开始磨洋工，磨到客户deadline临头，不能不付款就范；要么就走在耗尽体力直至放弃的不可逆道路上。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那么怎么扬名立万？", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 866}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "先竭尽全力达到能做出一点可靠贡献的及格线，然后宁可不要报酬、甚至给钱也要参与有价值的项目、跟对有价值的人。", "char_start": 867, "char_end": 920}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "能扬名立万的项目，本身就会按照上面的逻辑运行，而有价值的人，就是能跑通这种业务逻辑的人。", "char_start": 921, "char_end": 965}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "能打动这些人的，是近乎奋不顾身的职业热忱和近于宗教虔诚的品质追求。", "char_start": 966, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "我可能还不能帮你画图，但我已经可以帮你磨墨，帮你倒茶，我专门学过、练过，你让我试给你看看。", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1045}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "是那种能配得上能做出这种作品的师傅的墨和茶。", "char_start": 1046, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "人有没有前途，从这里已经可以看到。你如果做到了这个地步，凭着磨墨、倒茶也能行得进去。", "char_start": 1069, "char_end": 1111}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这就是通向“顾客改动就能加价”的正路，去吧。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1135}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：当客户的要求不断的变动，你会怎么应对？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“不改之路”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“先要确认预付款、修改费用、修改周期、终止合作条款这些关键的合同细节才能承接这个客户。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "先要确认预付款、修改费用、修改周期、终止合作条款这些关键的合同细节才能承接这个客户。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4bdf3401-dba9-56b2-9165-f3cad987b984", "source_ordinal": 875, "reading_ordinal": 3182, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "黑鹅说", "published_at": "2025-03-31T00:38:58.781000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/12736357438/answer/1889788282646295922"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题，我不就是活反例吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "谁要说我是“低自尊”，不知道多少被拉黑的人会跳起来拿棍子打ta。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "老实说，我自己都觉得我的自尊多得有点残暴了。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "然而论“擅长提供情绪价值”——我可能是整个知乎得到“喜欢”最多的作者。到现在回答+想法9000条，有206.9万“喜欢”。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "再加个“之一”吧——得到喜欢最多的作者之一。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一只黑天鹅正在唱着火锅吃着歌，刷手机发现有人在讨论“世界上为什么没有黑天鹅”……", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "火锅都掉手机里了。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这也不纯是一个笑话——当你要解释为什么存在某个现象的时候，寻找不符合这个现象特征的反例反而是你的首要任务。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "举个例子，比如某国生产的犁地机，刀片碰到石头就容易坏，你可以问“为什么犁地机的刀片碰到石头就会坏”。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但是在你笃信“遇石即坏”绝无反例的前提下，你得到的解释往往会指向“不要指望设计出能抗石头磕碰的刀片，不妨想办法把刀片做得更便宜”。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 379}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果你先找了反例，例如了解了世界上所有的犁地机，发现某些型号并不会出现这个现象，你的问题就会变成“为什么我的/我身边的犁地机刀片碰到石头就会坏”。", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这个问法可以给你带来的启发要远远的大于前一个问法。", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不是说前一种问法不会有收益，有还是有的——更便宜、更易更换的刀片设计也是进步——但是后一种研究问题的习惯很显然会有更大的空间。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "仔细比较，你就会发现“为什么世界上没有黑天鹅”和“为什么我见不到黑天鹅”这两个问题相比，前者明显是一个傲慢的问题。", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 601}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "一个对世界本身傲慢的问题——认为“我没见过”就等于“世上没有”，这样的念头当然会让世界握住鼠标的手指发白。", "char_start": 602, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "傲慢的人仍然得到自然法的怜悯，并不至于毫无所得。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但傲慢的人所得更少，少得多。", "char_start": 681, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不断的更少，总有一天要输掉鸦片战争的。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 715}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你要学会问谦卑的问题，谦卑的问题往往是更好的问题。", "char_start": 716, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "最后回答问题本身。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 752}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "张三在路边哭，他说饿。", "char_start": 753, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "李四长叹一身，把左腿切下给张三吃了。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 783}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "王五也在路边哭，他也说饿。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 798}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "赵六一拍巴掌——朋友，你算遇着了，[此处为预留广告位]有活动，介绍亲友注册，可获一百元优惠券。", "char_start": 799, "char_end": 846}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我分你五十，今天疯狂星期四。", "char_start": 847, "char_end": 861}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "悟空，你看懂了吗？", "char_start": 863, "char_end": 872}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "看不懂的话，这里有一本《练腿十八法》，介绍亲友加入素问可免费阅读。", "char_start": 873, "char_end": 906}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "就一条——学成之后莫说是我教的。", "char_start": 907, "char_end": 923}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么越「擅长提供情绪价值」的人，反而越容易陷入低自尊？你认可吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“黑鹅说”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题，我不就是活反例吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题，我不就是活反例吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1eb66c05-05c4-5d5e-aec1-a0818428f5c7", "source_ordinal": 874, "reading_ordinal": 3183, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "女所以容者", "published_at": "2025-03-31T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/00f48ce207cf11f09a0952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "化妆的真正精神源动力是什么？你们想过没有？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“妆”这个东西到底是画给谁看的？", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "妆从源头开始，就是画给神看的。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "男性出门打猎，在脸上身上画上花纹，于是得到了祖先神的护佑，以至于比起没有化妆的同伴更容易从猛兽手里逃脱。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "巫师画上妆，凶神恶煞，威力无穷。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "每一个玩过cosplay的玩家都有过“异灵注入身体”的体验。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "穿上制服、画上脸谱的心理效应完全同源。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "化妆所带来的心理快感也不例外。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "化妆带来的快感，并不是“修饰面容”“突出优点”这么浅薄，它是在化身为一个“理想的自我”。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一个降临此身的灵。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而这种转变之所以带给人快乐，是因为这个受邀请的灵是被确信的爱着的——被想象中的一个“它者”所爱。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这个“它者”随妆容的不同而不同——如果是巫师，那么这“它者”就是巫师所拜的神魔。", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果是军装，那么这个“它者”就是胜利之神。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而回到本题里，女性的妆容呢？这个“它者”就是一位理想中的爱人。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这不能被概括为“男人”，至少不是那些会使用“男人”这种词来概括这形象的那些人嘴里的“男人”。", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 437}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这是一位公平的裁判、宽容的君主、豪迈的勇者、温柔的医生、英明的领袖。", "char_start": 438, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一想到自己现在的状态必为这位命运天使所喜，人就会因此平添很多信心和勇气，并凭着这信心和勇气战胜痛苦、安享宁静和乐观。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这实际上和cosplay、部落勇士赋彩的感受类似。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这不是一种和性相关的暧昧体验，而是一种和信仰相关的豪迈体验。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这就是为什么女性会相当坚决的否定“我化妆是为了吸引男人”。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为仅仅是会受这状态吸引而生出觊觎之心的异性，是没有资格坐上女性心目中的那宝座的。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这样说，就像说一名士兵军容严整、威武肃穆，是为了“讨好上司升官”一样，是一种不言而喻的猥琐冒犯。", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "最讽刺的是，这些人绝不敢对这位军人说这话，因为ta们内心深处完全清楚这话的冒犯性。", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "ta们会对女性说这话，根本不是因为ta们不懂这话的冒犯亵渎之处，而是欺侮女性的被动地位，要在女性身上榨取权力感罢了。", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 810}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "挨打都不冤。", "char_start": 811, "char_end": 817}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女生打扮得漂漂亮亮，是为了彰显自己独立自信，还是为了迎合男权社会审美?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“女所以容者”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“化妆的真正精神源动力是什么？你们想过没有？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "化妆的真正精神源动力是什么？你们想过没有？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8400b128-2cd7-5399-ad34-d1bb3b18be28", "source_ordinal": 873, "reading_ordinal": 3184, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "地狱尽头", "published_at": "2025-03-31T15:32:50.256000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/15723708338/answer/1890062681437873955"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "看到一个小孩。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "大约只有四五岁，姥姥带着在吃早餐。早餐店是那种百年老品牌的连锁店。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "小孩坐在座位上，姥姥去排队买餐。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "小孩每隔大概一分钟就会大喊“姥姥，过来！”", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只要姥姥的瞬移术式还没完成，这小孩就会以两秒每次的频率沿指数曲线加大吟唱音量。", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“姥姥，过来！！”", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "“姥姥，你快过来！！！”", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "直到姥姥闪现。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "来了不是帮他干了点啥，就是低声解释几句。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "然后就又去排队买餐。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "然后又“快过来！”", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "又低声解释几句。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "然后又“过来！快过来！”", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "每一次都声震屋瓦，整个餐厅的人都听得到。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "循环n次之后，姥姥终于买到了一碗馄饨。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "接着开始喂馄饨。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一边喂，一边小声解释刚才为什么没有办法满足他的xx要求。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "然后要求“乖，张嘴”。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "小孩张嘴。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "“乖，张嘴对着我。”", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "小孩张着嘴转向姥姥方向——对，他刚才是张了嘴，对着桌子对面的我，而他姥姥坐在他旁边。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "接下来是无数个 小声解释 + 张嘴 + 张嘴对着我 + 小声解释 + 张嘴 + 张嘴对着我。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这位小孩整个过程中既不吭声表示接受他姥姥的解释，也没有看过他姥姥一眼——包括“张嘴对着我”的时候都没有。", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "从始至终，他跟他姥姥的对话可以用一种模式概括：小孩大声发出指令，不断重复指令，直到指令被满足或者在无限的小声解释中被下一个指令替代。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "姥姥仿佛一台提前上市的家政机器人。", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 551}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "我一直在观察这个奇妙的社会样本。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "问题倒并不在这个小孩如何奇葩上，而在于整个餐厅的人身上。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "不必太早，如果是在四五十年前，如果一个小孩当众这样的对待自己的姥姥，几乎毫无疑问会遭遇社会的严厉斥责。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "带你爹的师傅马上放下筷子——“你怎么能这么跟你外婆说话？马上道歉！不然马上告诉你爸屁股给你打开花！”", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你要再翻橇，说些欠教训的屁话，老张师傅当场脱鞋给你两下。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "“回去就说车间张爷爷打的，觉得我打得不对，让你爹来找我”。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你爹几个胆子敢去找张爷爷算账？师傅叫他罚站半小时他气都不敢出。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "老张师傅狠揍你一顿，你爹还得谢谢他，要跟师傅检讨自己家庭教育失误。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "如果家人胆敢护短，那么这家人就会被看作“毫无家教”的低贱人家，在整个厂区、乡里沦为笑柄并开始遭受实际损失——例如丢掉分房机会、失去承包权。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 897}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "因为你家子女是王八蛋，谅你家你也不会再有前途，把资源分给你家只会被你家的小畜生浪费掉。厂里、村里的资源是有限的，别家尚且吃不饱，谁要分给你们这种没有基本伦理道德的破落户吃？", "char_start": 898, "char_end": 984}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "公开场合对祖父母翻白眼、甩脸色、发号施令，是整个社区都不可容忍也不会为之辩解的大罪，爹妈不打你，爹妈以后就不要混了。", "char_start": 985, "char_end": 1043}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "爹妈哪怕为了恐惧这种羞耻之事对家门前途的影响，也往往要当众把小畜生明正典刑，打个屁股开花。", "char_start": 1044, "char_end": 1089}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "一家兄弟三个，小崽子要是敢做这种牲口事，都不能等爹妈动手，大哥二哥就得动手。大哥二哥敢不动手，自己都得挨一顿。", "char_start": 1090, "char_end": 1145}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你家没有家教，绝不是你家自己的私事，你也是在丢我们整个张氏家族的脸，丢我们整个大院的脸。", "char_start": 1146, "char_end": 1190}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你敢护短你试试？", "char_start": 1191, "char_end": 1199}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "现在这个强大的伦理网络不存在了。", "char_start": 1200, "char_end": 1216}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你家就只是你家，你家没有家教，既不是我们张氏家族的问题，也不是我们大院的问题。不再有与你利益息息相关的整个社区来提供这种社群压力，支持你、帮助你、迫使你执行正确的伦理教育。", "char_start": 1217, "char_end": 1303}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "相反，有无数的所谓“先进思想”“现代教育理念”以及受到青少年极大影响的网络舆论会站在这个小孩一边，鼓吹“无痛教育”“说服教育”“快乐教育”。", "char_start": 1304, "char_end": 1374}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "原本的同盟军，现在已经形同陌路，甚至站在了反面，父母与子女的权力平衡极大的向子女方向偏移了。", "char_start": 1375, "char_end": 1421}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "这个小孩就是一个经典的例子。", "char_start": 1422, "char_end": 1436}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "他无需任何智慧就可以通过简单试错发现“不断大声重复指令，指令就会得到满足”。", "char_start": 1437, "char_end": 1475}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "因为父母、祖父母们能对抗这种几乎毫无智商的策略的一切手段现在都是非法的、“不道德的”“反人权的”“不人道的”了。", "char_start": 1476, "char_end": 1532}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "你只能“讲道理”。", "char_start": 1533, "char_end": 1542}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "只能“积极沟通”。", "char_start": 1543, "char_end": 1552}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "不然你就要在违法、不道德、反人权、不人道中间选一个罪来犯。", "char_start": 1553, "char_end": 1582}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "ta还是个孩子嘛。", "char_start": 1583, "char_end": 1592}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "ta都哭了/自残/自杀了，你们还要要求这、要求那，你们也太残忍了。", "char_start": 1593, "char_end": 1626}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "父母实际上已经没有说“不”的权利了。不信你们谁觉得自己智慧超群，可以到评论区模拟一下说“不”，让模拟熊孩子们跟你打打对抗，看看你到最后除了放弃之外，到底有什么合法的手段和敢于自残、自杀的子女对抗。", "char_start": 1627, "char_end": 1725}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "一旦子女走了暴力对抗到底的道路，事实上已经被剥夺合法暴力权的父母就只剩下打破法律和“公共道德”边界的选择才有可能获得均势。", "char_start": 1726, "char_end": 1787}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "因为子女可以仗着“年幼无知”无限的、无责任的使用一切语言及行动的暴力行为，而父母却根本不行。", "char_start": 1788, "char_end": 1834}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "子女是没实力，但在社会舆论和法律的保护下，却有着事实的滥用暴力而不受追究的权利。", "char_start": 1835, "char_end": 1875}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "父母的确有实力，但却在社会舆论和法律的约束下，在事实上没有任何使用暴力的权利。", "char_start": 1876, "char_end": 1915}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "父母事实上只有“将已经被视为违法的暴力教育权外包”这一条选择了——这其实就是“戒网瘾学校”的真正生命力来源。", "char_start": 1916, "char_end": 1970}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "我替这位小男孩推算了很久，很遗憾，从他姥姥身上所折射出的整个家庭教育完全失灵的状态来看，这个家庭最后恐怕很大概率只有选择某种形态的“网瘾学校”这一个选择了。", "char_start": 1971, "char_end": 2049}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "别看他只有这么几岁，但他已经吃了恶魔的果实，并且找到了父母、祖父母的系统性弱点，充分的尝到了甜头，验证了“可行性“。", "char_start": 2050, "char_end": 2108}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "当然他的父母家人会尝试各种教育专家、心理医生、精神医师，但事实上这些人加在一起也对抗不了“不满足我，我绝不罢休”这一条无脑的策略。", "char_start": 2109, "char_end": 2174}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "ta们很可能最后只有诉诸戒瘾学校。", "char_start": 2175, "char_end": 2192}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 65}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0459"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：2025了，我能理解还有戒网瘾学校存在，但不懂为什么有父母要把孩子送进去，毛坦厂衡水满足不了他们吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062"], "summary": "围绕“地狱尽头”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“看到一个小孩。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "看到一个小孩。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
